3. US1 – User Login
User Story: As a user, I want to log in using a username and password so that I can securely access the application.
Acceptance Criteria
•	Login screen provides username and password fields.
•	Both username and password must be entered.
•	Credentials are checked against a valid user account.
•	Incorrect credentials display an error message and access is denied.
•	Successful login directs the user to the dashboard appropriate to their role.
Estimate: 5 SP – approximately 8 hours
Dependency: Foundation story; required for role-based access.
