4. US2 – User Logout
User Story: As a user, I want to log out of the application so that I can securely end my session.
Acceptance Criteria
•	A Logout option is visible while the user is logged in.
•	Selecting Logout clears the current authenticated user/session.
•	The user returns to the Login screen.
•	Protected functionality requires the user to authenticate again.
Estimate: 2 SP – approximately 2.5 hours
