5. US3 – User Account and Role Management
User Story: As a fleet manager, I want to create and manage user accounts and control role-based access so that drivers and managers receive the appropriate application permissions.
Acceptance Criteria
•	Only an authorised fleet manager can access account management.
•	Fleet manager can create a new user account.
•	Accounts can be assigned Driver or Fleet Manager roles.
•	Existing users can be displayed.
•	Fleet manager can delete an existing account.
•	Role information is retained and controls access after login.
Estimate: 5 SP – approximately 9.5 hours
Dependency: US1 – User Login.
