6. US4 – Create Vehicle
User Story: As a fleet manager, I want to create vehicle records and register vehicles in the fleet system so that the application maintains an accurate list of fleet vehicles.
Acceptance Criteria
•	Vehicle record contains Vehicle ID, registration, make, model, fuel type and current odometer reading.
•	Required information is validated before saving.
•	Saved vehicle appears in the Vehicle List.
•	Duplicate registration numbers are rejected.
•	Invalid vehicle information displays an appropriate error.
•	Only a Fleet Manager can create vehicle records.
Estimate: 5 SP – approximately 9 hours
Dependency: US3 – User & Role Management / Fleet Manager access.
