7. US5 – Edit and Delete Vehicle
User Story: As a fleet manager, I want to edit or remove vehicle records so that fleet information remains accurate and up to date.
Acceptance Criteria
•	Fleet manager can select an existing vehicle.
•	Existing vehicle information can be edited and saved.
•	Changes immediately appear in the Vehicle List.
•	Vehicle can be deleted with a confirmation step.
•	Deleted vehicle is removed from the Vehicle List.
•	Invalid updates are not saved.
•	Only Fleet Managers can edit or delete vehicle records.
